OL,3,ACalifornia warns of flooding as King   
OL,4,ATides peak over Thanksgiving           
OL,6,FCoastal areas of California are bracing
OL,7,Ffor potential flooding as king tides   
OL,8,Fpeak in the state during the US        
OL,9,FThanksgiving holiday.                  
OL,11,FWater levels across the US state's vast
OL,12,Fcoastline could reach over 8ft (2.4    
OL,13,Fmetres) in some areas on Wednesday and 
OL,14,FThursday, according to the National    
OL,15,FWeather Service (NWS) - breaking       
OL,16,Frecords set just last month.           
OL,18,FThe NWS has warned parts of California 
OL,19,Fcould face major coastal flooding,     
OL,20,Fwhich is likely to be significant in   
OL,21,Flow-lying areas. There have already    
OL,22,Fbeen some reports of flooding.         
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
